C10.X04.human","C10.X05.human","C10.X061.human","C10.X062.human","C10.X063.human","C10.X064.human","C10.X07.human","END.X01.human","END.H01.human"],"flags":["H_MET_G","R1_SURVEYED_H","return-ring.elf.scene-open","H_CARAVAN_RESCUE","H_CARAVAN_IDENTIFIED","CARAVAN_ROUTES_RECORDED","CONTACT_H_D","CARGO_ROUTE_SPLIT","CONTACT_H_G","G_GRAIN_ROUTE_SHARED","return-ring.human.scene-open","H_CARGO_RESCUED_PART","H_DWARF_WAR_REPORT","return-ring.recipe-revealed","return-ring.dwarf.scene-open","return-ring.goblin.scene-open","return-ring.ashen.scene-open","C06_COMPLETE","WAR_DECLARED","H_WAR_CORRIDOR_DONE","C07_OPENING_COMPLETE","SELECTED_HERO_SEAL_ROUTE_KNOWN","E_SEALED","E_RESCUE_FIRST_CLEARED","E_RESCUE_SECOND_CLEARED","E_RESCUE_WEDGE_USED","E_SEAL_OUTER_OPENED","E_UNSEALED","MAIN_ALTAR_ROUTE_FOUND","PRIEST_MORTALITY_MOTIVE_HEARD","ASHEN_ORIGIN_CLAIM_HEARD","RITUAL_CAST_INTERRUPTED","RITUAL_SUCCEEDED","PRIEST_DIED_BACKLASH","INVASION_BEGAN","ACTIVE_MARKS_RECORDED","TEMPLE_RETURN_PLANNED","C08_COMPLETE","R4_TEMPLE_CONFIRMED","ASHEN_ORIGIN_CORROBORATED","FOUR_SUPPORTS_IDENTIFIED","FIVE_HERO_CONTACTS_REACHED","C09_COMPLETE","H_INVASION_RESISTED","FIVE_HEROES_BRIEFED","FINAL_ROLES_ASSIGNED","FINAL_APPROACH_CLEARED","SUPPORT_TEAMS_READY","FINAL_BOSS_CHECKPOINT","SUPPORT_1_DOWN","SUPPORT_2_DOWN","SUPPORT_3_DOWN","SUPPORT_4_DOWN","PORTAL_CLOSED","MAIN_STORY_CLEAR","FINAL_REUNION","EPILOGUE_COMPLETE"],"knowledge":[{"id":"C01.X01.human.k0","text":"旧石室有陌生、未发光的刻纹；用途不明。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C01.X01.human"},{"id":"C03.H01.human.k0","text":"指定矮人商队遇袭，人员与所有货物都需要追查。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C03.H01.human"},{"id":"C03.X01.human.k0","text":"车夫目击一个烬裔独自带走核心；最初袭击者身份仍未知。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C03.X01.human"},{"id":"C04.HD01.human.k0","text":"罗什福尔追人员及所有失货，布洛克追王室遗物；运输单据有疑点而非完整罪证。","mode":"confirmed","sourceScene":"C04.HD01.human"},{"id":"C04.G01.human.k0","text":"奇克指出藏货点后离开，并未加入永久队伍。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C04.G01.human"},{"id":"C05.O01.human.k0","text":"货检棚传来口信：遗物仍未追回。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C05.O01.human"},{"id":"C06.H01.human.k0","text":"布洛克正在救矿里的人，矮人内乱导致矿道受阻；尚未收到地下石台记录。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C06.H01.human"},{"id":"C06.RR01.human.k0","text":"学会归途之环图样；五件一次性旧物丢失后无法补领。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C06.RR01.human"},{"id":"C07.O01.human.k0","text":"商路被军队封锁；莱姆斯救护队来信说明前线伤员困境，没有提及大祭司隐秘动机。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C07.O01.human"},{"id":"C07.O02.human.k0","text":"幸存救护者报告莱姆斯阻止大祭司弃军，被封在前线；砾恩留在封印外求援。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C07.O02.human"},{"id":"C08.O13.human.k0","text":"从外侧稳住封印，配合莱姆斯使用他持有的旧制楔钉解开核心；楔钉已耗尽。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C08.O13.human"},{"id":"C08.X01.human.k0","text":"莱姆斯已经解封，与砾恩带着戒心同行；大祭司夺走的是族长自身核心。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C08.X01.human"},{"id":"C08.X02.human.k0","text":"大祭司取得族长核心后独自赶往主祭坛；仍不知道他的惧死动机。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C08.X02.human"},{"id":"C08.X03.human.k0","text":"大祭司在主祭坛承认自己惧死，宣称曾与古代两位国王创造烬裔；古代身份与起源仍待独立记录印证。","mode":"heard","sourceScene":"C08.X03.human"},{"id":"C08.X04A.human.k0","text":"持续施法已被打断，核心仍自行运转；仅让大祭司停手已经无用。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C08.X04A.human"},{"id":"C08.X04.human.k0","text":"仪式成功，恶魔入侵，大祭司死于反噬；门户仍运转。精灵与烬裔转向抵抗入侵，全境敌对封锁解除，并不代表和解。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C08.X04.human"},{"id":"C08.X05.human.k0","text":"砾恩认为激活刻纹与古神庙相似，需要返查；尚不能确认四座支撑祭坛。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C08.X05.human"},{"id":"C09.A01.human.k0","text":"亲自随砾恩返查：旧座下的连接支撑中央门户，古神庙是第四处支撑祭坛，不是另一座中央祭坛。","mode":"confirmed","sourceScene":"C09.A01.human"},{"id":"C09.X01.human.k0","text":"旧记录与主祭坛当场承认相互印证：古代人族国王、矮人王及这位大祭司共同创造烬裔以抵抗外界入侵。","mode":"confirmed","sourceScene":"C09.X01.human"},{"id":"C09.X02.human.k0","text":"守林者、矿班长、边境斥候与砾恩的现场记录共同确认四座既存支撑：粮路石室、枯泉遗址、矿道遗址、古神庙；中央主祭坛另计。","mode":"confirmed","sourceScene":"C09.X02.human"},{"id":"C09.X03.human.k0","text":"传信路线已经打通。五人的回信陆续送到，会合地点、支撑位置与撤离方向都已核对。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C09.X03.human"},{"id":"C10.H01.human.k0","text":"避难者已穿过清出的通路，追回的货物也移到了城门内。","mode":"confirmed","sourceScene":"C10.H01.human"},{"id":"C10.X01.human.k0","text":"布洛克与记录者的账证、证词证实重臣盗卖王室遗物资助夺权。五人核实四座支撑、两枚不同核心与古代记录；并未因此使各族和解。","mode":"confirmed","sourceScene":"C10.X01.human"},{"id":"C10.X03.human.k0","text":"中央由罗什福尔独自承担；第1支撑 · 粮路石室：奇克；地图、带路人与撤路已确认。；第2支撑 · 枯泉遗址：莱姆斯；地图、带路人与撤路已确认。；第3支撑 · 矿道遗址：布洛克；地图、带路人与撤路已确认。；第4支撑 · 古神庙：砾恩；地图、带路人与撤路已确认。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X03.human"},{"id":"C10.X04.human.k0","text":"中央通路已清，其他四人确认到达各自支撑入口。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X04.human"},{"id":"C10.X05.human.k0","text":"首领被迫退开，但四道支撑仍在向门户输送力量，战斗尚未结束。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X05.human"},{"id":"C10.X061.human.k0","text":"第一道纹路熄灭，首领失去额外伤害支撑。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X061.human"},{"id":"C10.X062.human.k0","text":"第二道纹路熄灭，水道仍完好，首领失去额外防护。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X062.human"},{"id":"C10.X063.human.k0","text":"第三道纹路熄灭，首领失去恢复支撑；矿工已撤出，矿区未被炸塌。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X063.human"},{"id":"C10.X064.human.k0","text":"第四道纹路熄灭，援军来源切断，门户关闭；砾恩的核心仍在，已入侵的首领仍须击败。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X064.human"},{"id":"C10.X07.human.k0","text":"四座支撑全部断开，你击败了守在中央的入侵首领。门户终于关闭，但已经闯入各地的敌人仍需清理。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"C10.X07.human"},{"id":"END.X01.human.k0","text":"其他四人已从支撑路线返回。门已关闭，但残留敌人、失货与修复尚待继续，各族未立即和解。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"END.X01.human"},{"id":"END.H01.human.k0","text":"门户已经关闭，各人的归路却还没有走完。你可以继续探索、清理残敌，或回去探望仍在等消息的人。","mode":"seen","sourceScene":"END.H01.human"}],"choices":{"C01.H01.human":"pursue","C01.X01.human":"survey","C02.O01.human":"continue","C03.H01.human":"continue","C03.X01.human":"register","C04.HD01.human":"compare","C04.G01.human":"cargo","C05.O01.human":"continue","C06.H01.human":"escort","C06.RR01.human":"learn","C07.O01.human":"protect","C07.O02.human":"proceed","C08.O11.human":"proceed","C08.O12.human":"proceed","C08.O13.human":"proceed","C08.X01.human":"proceed","C08.X02.human":"proceed","C08.X03.human":"proceed","C08.X04A.human":"proceed","C08.X04.human":"proceed","C08.X05.human":"proceed","C09.A01.human":"proceed","C09.X01.human":"proceed","C09.X02.human":"proceed","C09.X03.human":"proceed","C10.H01.human"